# The two PDFs under build/ are committed so the QR code on the cover leads
# somewhere readable without anyone installing LaTeX. Everything else in
# there is a build intermediate and is regenerated by `make`.
build/*
!build/voicings-screen.pdf
!build/voicings-print.pdf

*.aux
*.log
*.out
*.synctex.gz
.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.pyc
